// Keezly — shared build configuration.
//
// Anything developer- or account-specific belongs in Local.xcconfig, which is
// git-ignored. This file is committed and must stay free of team ids,
// credentials and machine paths (§106, §158).

// Optional include: builds work without it (simulator), and a developer who
// needs device signing drops their team id into Local.xcconfig.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
